'''Ceaseless Feast''' is a pair of [[unique]] {{il|Spiked Gloves}}. 

==Mechanics==

{{c|mod|(20–30)% chance to inflict [[Corrosion]] on Hit with Attacks}}: Corrosion is a stacking debuff that causes -5000 to Armour and -1000 to Evasion Rating per stack. Corrosion lasts for 4 seconds and inflicting a stack refreshes the duration of all existing Corrosion stacks.

{{Item acquisition}}

